        ('Business parks','Birchwood and the office parks off the M62 run floor plates with a cold north side and a glazed south side. Zoned cassettes or VRF with proper controls stop the thermostat war that follows.'),
        ('Distribution and logistics','High bay units where cooling the whole volume is never economic. Spot cooling over pick stations and offices, with destratification fans bringing the warm air back down in winter.'),
