        ('Freeholder and management consent','Nearly every apartment job needs approval before anything is fixed outside. We prepare the request with unit positions, noise figures and photographs, which is the difference between an approval and a refusal.'),
        ('Systems with no outdoor unit','Where a condenser genuinely cannot be fixed to the building, self contained units that vent through a small core hole are the fallback. They are less efficient and noisier than a split, and we will say so, but they work where nothing else is permitted.'),
